category: Libs
requires: cygwin libdb18.1 libiconv2 libsasl2_3 libssl3 zlib0
sdesc: "Mail Framework for C Language (runtime)"
ldesc: "The purpose of this mail library is to provide a portable, efficient framework
for different kinds of mail access: IMAP, SMTP, POP and NNTP."
